.TH "AG\-CLI\-USER\-EDIT" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-user\-edit \- Edit the authenticated user's profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli user edit [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Edit supported profile fields for the authenticated AtomGit user.
.PP
\&Only flags explicitly provided are sent to AtomGit. Pass an empty string to
\&clear a supported field. This command does not upload avatar files, verify
\&email addresses, or rename the account login.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-avatar <string>\fR
\&Avatar URL
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-company <string>\fR
\&Company name
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-description <string>\fR
\&Profile description
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-email <string>\fR
\&Public email address
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-github\-account <string>\fR
\&GitHub account name
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output the updated profile as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-location <string>\fR
\&Profile location
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-nickname <string>\fR
\&Profile nickname
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-website <string>\fR
\&Website URL
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli user edit \-\-nickname \(dqAlice\(dq \-\-company \(dqExample Inc.\(dq
\&  ag\-cli user edit \-\-description \(dq\(dq \-\-location \(dqWuhan\(dq
\&  ag\-cli user edit \-\-website \(dqhttps://example.com\(dq \-\-json
.fi
